OL,3,GNEWSACouncil manager stole #120,000
OL,4,Aworth of laptops and iPads
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council manager who stole laptops and
OL,7,FiPads earmarked for vulnerable people
OL,8,Fduring the pandemic has been ordered to
OL,9,Fcarry out unpaid work.
OL,11,FBobby Lee Smith, 37, from East
OL,12,FKilbride, a manager at Glasgow City
OL,13,FHealth and Social Care Partnership
OL,14,F(HSCP), oversaw applications for a
OL,15,Fproject that gave out electronic
OL,16,Fdevices to low-income individuals.
OL,18,FGlasgow Sheriff Court heard he abused
OL,19,Fhis position and stole 129 Chromebooks
OL,20,Fand 301 iPads worth a combined value of
OL,21,F#124,644.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
